[en.FOCUS_C15_CHANGELING_ENEMY]
Negotiate with the Changelings

[en.FOCUS_C15_CHANGELING_ENEMY_desc]
The Crystal Empire needs to show a strong stance and negotiate with the Changeling Empire to seriously and thoroughly resolve the remaining issues of the Pact in order to get rid of the control of the Changeling Empire.\nThough this may also lead to a war, we have no other choice.

[zh.FOCUS_C15_CHANGELING_ENEMY]
与幻形灵谈判

[zh.FOCUS_C15_CHANGELING_ENEMY_desc]
水晶帝国想要摆脱幻形灵帝国的控制，就必须展示出强硬的姿态与幻形灵帝国进行谈判，严肃而彻底地解决《协定》遗留问题。\n虽然，这也有可能会引发一场战争，但是，我们别无选择。

